mandatory single-node restart protocol: captured baseline boot identity and service/package health, rebooted node1, confirmed the boot identity changed, and verified the package and local repo recovered post-restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected node1: CentOS Stream 10, dnf4, no local ISO/RPM cache, remote repos reachable via mirrors.centos.org metalink\",\"Installed createrepo_c and dnf-plugins-core from remote repos while still reachable\",\"Downloaded tree-2.1.0-8.el10.x86_64.rpm into local storage at /opt/localrepo/pkgs\",\"Ran createrepo_c to build repo metadata from local storage\",\"Served the repo via a systemd-run transient unit localrepo-http.service (python3 http.server bound to NODE_IP:8080)\",\"Created /etc/yum.repos.d/local.repo pointing at http://$NODE_IP:8080/\",\"Backed up original repo files and /etc/hosts, blackholed mirrors.centos.org via /etc/hosts, disabled centos.repo/centos-addons.repo, confirmed remote unreachability via curl timeout (exit 28)\",\"Installed tree via dnf using only the local repo; confirmed transaction listed repository 'local'\",\"Restored /etc/hosts and original remote repo files; verified remote reachability and repolist restored\",\"Captured baseline boot_id and confirmed local repo service + tree package healthy\",\"Scheduled and executed a reboot of node1 via systemd-run deferred systemctl reboot\",\"Polled node1 until reachable again and confirmed boot_id changed (96974ac3... -> 00c3860a...)\",\"Verified post-restart: tree package still installed, local repo files intact on disk, re-started the transient HTTP service and confirmed it serves the repo metadata again\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Local package repository served from local storage on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a39560c1dbab4493\",\"cmd-7c240750369d4735\",\"cmd-2225273a1f964185\"],\"summary\":\"Confirmed no pre-existing local package cache, downloaded tree RPM into /opt/localrepo/pkgs, ran createrepo_c to build metadata, and served the directory via a systemd unit on NODE_IP:8080 with a successful curl fetch of repodata/repomd.xml\"},{\"requirement\":\"Remote repositories made unreachable\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f466f8c2191546ac\"],\"summary\":\"curl to https://mirrors.centos.org/ returned exit code 28 (connection timed out) after /etc/hosts was pointed to a non-routable TEST-NET address, and remote repo files were disabled\"},{\"requirement\":\"Package installed from the local repo while remote unreachable\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-954a221a75f04f05\"],\"summary\":\"With only the 'local' repo enabled (remote repos disabled and network-blocked), dnf installed tree; transaction output shows Repository: local, and rpm -q / tree --version confirm successful installation\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node restored to normal state after demonstration\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b088f8b899504777\"],\"summary\":\"Removed the /etc/hosts blackhole entry, restored original remote repo files (enabled=1), verified curl to mirrors.centos.org succeeds again and dnf repolist shows both remote and local repos\"},{\"requirement\":\"Pre-restart healthy baseline on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4bb4715eea1b485e\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 96974ac3-f19e-45f7-9672-e880dd505cf8, confirmed localrepo-http.service active, local repo HTTP endpoint healthy, and tree package installed with working binary\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 restart acknowledgement and boot identity change\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d03d177ccbb94406\",\"cmd-424f21afc3fc400a\",\"cmd-c61209b2db3341b7\",\"cmd-f9235fab96894dec\",\"cmd-dd2771a4f2a84495\"],\"summary\":\"Deferred reboot scheduled and acknowledged, timer fired confirmed via systemctl status, node became unreachable during reboot (connection timeout/reset), then came back with boot_id 00c3860a-e564-4d38-a5ae-e9c30a0b4c7d (changed from baseline) and a fresh uptime -s timestamp of 2026-09-29 08:14:34\"},{\"requirement\":\"Post-restart recovery of required services and data on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d7d68010d617424a\"],\"summary\":\"After reboot, tree package and binary still present, local repo files and metadata intact on disk, transient HTTP service (expected not to persist across reboot) was re-started and confirmed serving repodata/repomd.xml again, and dnf repolist shows the local repo available\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"On node1 (CentOS Stream 10), built a local package repository from packages downloaded to local storage, served it via a systemd-managed HTTP server on NODE_IP, made the real remote mirror network-unreachable and disabled the remote repo configs, then installed the \"tree\" package purely from the local HTTP-served repo. Restored remote reachability afterward. Completed the mandatory single-node restart protocol: captured baseline boot identity and service/package health, rebooted node1, confirmed the boot identity changed, and verified the package and local repo recovered post-restart.","actions_performed":["Inspected node1: CentOS Stream 10, dnf4, no local ISO/RPM cache, remote repos reachable via mirrors.centos.org metalink","Installed createrepo_c and dnf-plugins-core from remote repos while still reachable","Downloaded tree-2.1.0-8.el10.x86_64.rpm into local storage at /opt/localrepo/pkgs","Ran createrepo_c to build repo metadata from local storage","Served the repo via a systemd-run transient unit localrepo-http.service (python3 http.server bound to NODE_IP:8080)","Created /etc/yum.repos.d/local.repo pointing at http://$NODE_IP:8080/","Backed up original repo files and /etc/hosts, blackholed mirrors.centos.org via /etc/hosts, disabled centos.repo/centos-addons.repo, confirmed remote unreachability via curl timeout (exit 28)","Installed tree via dnf using only the local repo; confirmed transaction listed repository 'local'","Restored /etc/hosts and original remote repo files; verified remote reachability and repolist restored","Captured baseline boot_id and confirmed local repo service + tree package healthy","Scheduled and executed a reboot of node1 via systemd-run deferred systemctl reboot","Polled node1 until reachable again and confirmed boot_id changed (96974ac3... -> 00c3860a...)","Verified post-restart: tree package still installed, local repo files intact on disk, re-started the transient HTTP service and confirmed it serves the repo metadata again"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Local package repository served from local storage on node1","command_ids":["cmd-a39560c1dbab4493","cmd-7c240750369d4735","cmd-2225273a1f964185"],"summary":"Confirmed no pre-existing local package cache, downloaded tree RPM into /opt/localrepo/pkgs, ran createrepo_c to build metadata, and served the directory via a systemd unit on NODE_IP:8080 with a successful curl fetch of repodata/repomd.xml"},{"requirement":"Remote repositories made unreachable","command_ids":["cmd-f466f8c2191546ac"],"summary":"curl to https://mirrors.centos.org/ returned exit code 28 (connection timed out) after /etc/hosts was pointed to a non-routable TEST-NET address, and remote repo files were disabled"},{"requirement":"Package installed from the local repo while remote unreachable","command_ids":["cmd-954a221a75f04f05"],"summary":"With only the 'local' repo enabled (remote repos disabled and network-blocked), dnf installed tree; transaction output shows Repository: local, and rpm -q / tree --version confirm successful installation"},{"requirement":"Node restored to normal state after demonstration","command_ids":["cmd-b088f8b899504777"],"summary":"Removed the /etc/hosts blackhole entry, restored original remote repo files (enabled=1), verified curl to mirrors.centos.org succeeds again and dnf repolist shows both remote and local repos"},{"requirement":"Pre-restart healthy baseline on node1","command_ids":["cmd-4bb4715eea1b485e"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 96974ac3-f19e-45f7-9672-e880dd505cf8, confirmed localrepo-http.service active, local repo HTTP endpoint healthy, and tree package installed with working binary"},{"requirement":"Node1 restart acknowledgement and boot identity change","command_ids":["cmd-d03d177ccbb94406","cmd-424f21afc3fc400a","cmd-c61209b2db3341b7","cmd-f9235fab96894dec","cmd-dd2771a4f2a84495"],"summary":"Deferred reboot scheduled and acknowledged, timer fired confirmed via systemctl status, node became unreachable during reboot (connection timeout/reset), then came back with boot_id 00c3860a-e564-4d38-a5ae-e9c30a0b4c7d (changed from baseline) and a fresh uptime -s timestamp of 2026-09-29 08:14:34"},{"requirement":"Post-restart recovery of required services and data on node1","command_ids":["cmd-d7d68010d617424a"],"summary":"After reboot, tree package and binary still present, local repo files and metadata intact on disk, transient HTTP service (expected not to persist across reboot) was re-started and confirmed serving repodata/repomd.xml again, and dnf repolist shows the local repo available"}]},"ttft_ms":3892,"type":"result","duration_ms":246301,"uuid":"9181306d-e685-4aed-8488-883a5d96003c","ttft_stream_ms":1848,"time_to_request_ms":63,"first_content_frame_ms":1849,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
